  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/9f1f11fbb4e091305a6b414e74c3aec25b8d519670a1f3bd65f5bd4eb1bdcd68.png] \n\nGiven equation: 9 _ 3 _ 0 _ 8 _ 2 = 23\n\nOption 1) + - × ÷\n\nBy putting the signs in the equation:\n\n⇒ 9 + 3 - 0 × __**8 **____**÷**____** 2**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 9 + 3 - __**0 × 4**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**9 + 3 - 0**__ = 23\n\n⇒ 12 = 23\n\n**Option 2) × + - ÷**\n\nBy putting the signs in the equation:\n\n⇒ 9 × 3 + 0 - __**8 ÷ 2**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**9 × 3**__ + 0 - 4 = 23\n\n⇒ __**27 + 0 - 4**__ = 23\n\n**⇒ 23 = 23**\n\nOption 3) ÷ + - ×\n\nBy putting the signs in the equation:\n\n⇒ __**9 ÷ 3**__ + 0 - 8 × 2 = 23\n\n⇒ 3 + 0 - __**8 × 2**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**3 - 4**__ = 23\n\n⇒ -1 = 23\n\nOption 4) - + ÷ ×\n\nBy putting the signs in the equation:\n\n⇒ 9 - 3 + __**0 ÷ 8**__ × 2 = 23\n\n⇒ 9 - 3 + __**0 × 2**__ = 23\n\n⇒ __**9 - 3**__ + 0 = 23\n\n⇒ 6 = 23\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"× + - ÷\".**",
